[b]Bestiary Lens[/b]

Aim at an enemy in Queen's Domain to see its unlocked bestiary information on a small card.

[b]Install[/b]

Requires the Windows game build and a working UE4SS installation with Lua support and LoopInGameThreadWithDelay. The development baseline was UE4SS v3.0.1 Beta #0; other builds are unverified.

Download the BestiaryLens ZIP from [url=https://github.com/rafal-zelek/bestiary-lens-queens-domain-mod/releases]GitHub Releases[/url]. If no release is listed, no release package is available there yet. Source archives are not installable packages.

Close the game. Find your UE4SS folder containing UE4SS-settings.ini and Mods (commonly QueensDomain/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss). Copy Mods/BestiaryLens from the ZIP into its Mods folder, keep the empty enabled.txt, and launch the game normally.

[b]Use[/b]

Aim at an unlocked enemy. Press F9 to toggle the card or F10 to open its bestiary entry. Stats and drop rates are base values; actual results can differ.
